@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userId = u100
@tripId = replace-with-created-trip-uuid

### 通用推荐：无需档案，仍须 mock 身份
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/routes
X-Mock-Actor-Id: {{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Role: ELDER

### 档案推荐：先按 profile-family.http 建档
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/routes?userId={{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Id: {{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Role: ELDER

### 显式条件覆盖，不改写档案
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/routes?userId={{userId}}&walkDurationMin=70&avoidSteps=false
X-Mock-Actor-Id: {{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Role: ELDER

### 高德地图补充接口：每次调用会发起坐标转换和逐段步行规划，需要本地配置 Web 服务 Key
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/routes/r1/map
X-Mock-Actor-Id: {{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Role: ELDER

### 开始游览，复制响应 data.id 到顶部 tripId；同一老人重复创建 ACTIVE 返回 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/trips?userId={{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Id: {{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Role: ELDER
Content-Type: application/json

{"routeId":"r1"}

### 查询游览
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/trips/{{tripId}}?userId={{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Id: {{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Role: ELDER

### 结束游览
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/trips/{{tripId}}/finish?userId={{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Id: {{userId}}
X-Mock-Actor-Role: ELDER
